{"sha": "f81ade61c120b76fdbd43f74e5118ab4ddef264b9294338e2132f98a1a1f07d9", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:wave-propagation} 章 --- 信号的传播：行波与驻波}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:wave-propagation:1}", "$d = 340 \\times 6.0 = \\qty{2.0}{km}$。往返：深度 $= 1500 \\times", "0.40/2 = \\qty{300}{m}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:wave-propagation:2}", "$\\lambda = 340/440 = \\qty{0.77}{m}$；$\\Delta\\varphi = 2\\pi \\times", "0.20/0.773 = \\qty{1.6}{rad}$（$93^\\circ$）；相距", "$n\\lambda = n \\times \\qty{0.77}{m}$ 时同相。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:wave-propagation:3}", "$c = \\sqrt{80/4.0\\times10^{-3}} = \\qty{141}{m/s}$；$\\lambda = c/f =", "\\qty{0.71}{m}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:wave-propagation:4}", "$444 - 440 = 4$，即每秒 4 拍；包络周期 $1/4 = \\qty{0.25}{s}$。", "放松弦线使音调降低：为 \\qty{441}{Hz}（若降至 \\qty{439}{Hz}，", "则须先经过 \\qty{440}{Hz} 处的静音）；再稍多放松，以检验", "拍音须消失，然后重新出现。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:wave-propagation:5}", "$f_1 = c/2L = 240/1.2 = \\qty{200}{Hz}$；$400$、\\qty{600}{Hz}。第三模式：", "节点位于 $0$、$0.20$、$0.40$、\\qty{0.60}{m} 处。在距一端 \\qty{20}{cm}（或", "\\qty{40}{cm}）处触碰弦线，该处为节点，只保留 $n = 3, 6, \\dots$ 的模式，", "于是弦线发出 \\qty{600}{Hz} 的声音。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:wave-propagation:6}", "$\\lambda = \\qty{0.40}{m}$。在两扬声器之间的线段上，距扬声器 1 为 $x$ 处，", "$\\delta = (2.0 - x) - x = 2.0 - 2x$；当 $\\delta = \\pm\\lambda/2,", "\\pm 3\\lambda/2, \\dots$ 时静音：$x = 0.1, 0.3, \\dots, 1.9$ m，每隔 \\qty{20}{cm}；", "中点处为强音。在中垂线上 $\\delta = 0$，处处为强音（仅有", "$1/r$ 的衰减）。反相时强弱互换：中点处静音，且", "距中点每隔 \\qty{20}{cm} 处亦静音。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:wave-propagation:7}", "$i = \\lambda D/a = 5.89\\times10^{-7} \\times 1.5/2.0\\times10^{-4} =", "\\qty{4.4}{mm}$；蓝光为 \\qty{3.4}{mm}。在 $\\pm\\qty{1.0}{cm}$ 范围内，条纹位于", "$0$、$\\pm 4.4$、$\\pm 8.8$ mm 处——共五条。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:wave-propagation:8}", "等幅时：$I_{\\max} = 4I_0$，$I_{\\min} = 0$，对比度 $1$。$I_0$ 与 $I_0/4$：", "$I_{\\max} = I_0(1 + \\tfrac14 + 2 \\times \\tfrac12) = 2.25I_0$，$I_{\\min} =", "I_0(1.25 - 1) = 0.25I_0$；对比度 $2.0/2.5 = 0.8$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:wave-propagation:9}", "一端闭、一端开：$f = (2n + 1)c/4L = 170$、$510$、\\qty{850}{Hz}（仅有奇次谐波：单簧管）。", "两端开：$nc/2L = 340$、$680$、", "\\qty{1020}{Hz}（长笛）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:wave-propagation:10}", "$v_\\varphi = \\sqrt{9.81 \\times 10/2\\pi} = \\qty{3.9}{m/s}$；波长 \\qty{100}{m} 时", "为 \\qty{12.5}{m/s}。长涌浪先到：$10^6/12.5 =", "\\qty{22}{h}$，而短波需 $10^6/3.95 = \\qty{70}{h}$，相差两天。波速", "取决于波长：混合海浪在传播中会", "按波长自行分开——即色散。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:wave-propagation:11}", "模式 $n$ 的形状为 $\\sin(n\\pi x/L)$。若在 $x = L/3$ 处强制为节点，则需", "$\\sin(n\\pi/3) = 0$，即 $n$ 为 $3$ 的倍数：频率为 $3f_1,", "6f_1, \\dots$。在 $L/2$ 处拨弦，弦线在该处的位移最大，", "模式 $n$ 只有当 $\\sin(n\\pi/2) \\neq 0$ 时才能对此有贡献：", "偶数模式在 $L/2$ 处为节点，不被激发。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:wave-propagation:12}", "$\\lambda = c/f = \\qty{3.0}{m}$。相位差为 $2\\pi(2d)/\\lambda + \\pi$；", "当其等于 $(2m + 1)\\pi$ 时相消：$2d/\\lambda = m$，", "$d = m\\lambda/2 = 0, 1.5, 3.0, \\dots$ m；当 $2d/\\lambda =", "m + \\tfrac12$ 时相长：$d = 0.75, 2.25, \\dots$ m。隧道壁与车顶会反射该波，", "形成驻波图样，沿", "汽车的行驶路径，每隔半个波长出现一处静点。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:wave-propagation:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $[F/\\mu] = M L T^{-2}/(M L^{-1}) = L^2 T^{-2}$，是", "速率的平方。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 沿 $-x$ 方向传播的波依赖于 $t + x/c$，即依赖于", "$\\omega t + kx$；$k = \\omega/c = 2\\pi f/c$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $c = \\sqrt{0.90/1.0\\times10^{-3}} = \\qty{30}{m/s}$；", "$\\lambda = c/f = \\qty{0.60}{m}$；$k = 2\\pi/\\lambda = \\qty{10.5}{rad/m}$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $\\Delta\\varphi = kd = 10.5 \\times 0.15 = \\qty{1.6}{rad} = \\pi/2$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $v_{\\max} = A\\omega = 2.0\\times10^{-3} \\times 2\\pi \\times 50 =", "\\qty{0.63}{m/s}$，比 $c$ 小五十倍：弦线上各点运动缓慢，", "而波形沿弦线迅速传播。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 波沿 $+x$ 方向传播，相位为 $\\omega t - kx$。在固定端，", "合位移在任何时刻均为零：$s_i(0, t) + s_r(0, t)", "= A\\cos\\omega t + (-A)\\cos\\omega t = 0$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $\\cos(\\omega t + kx) - \\cos(\\omega t - kx) =", "-2\\sin(\\omega t)\\sin(kx)$，故 $s = -2A\\sin(kx)\\sin(\\omega t)$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 节点：$\\sin kx = 0$，$x = n\\lambda/2$；波腹：$x = (n +", "\\tfrac12)\\lambda/2$；相邻节点相距 $\\lambda/2$。", ""]}